==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*6 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Red EnerG]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Seijuro Hiko (Enemy)|Seijuro Hiko]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns.
**5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Puffzerker]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.

